# Two nodes converse over a bus: the host opens a bus and emits its marker, the
# guest joins it; they exchange a scripted back-and-forth, then the host closes
# the bus. With the host's `pauseSeconds` set, the host waits on a timer after
# the first exchange, so the run pauses with the bus open and carries on.

host = BusChatHost
guest = BusChatGuest
out = Debug

guest.channel = host.channel
out.data = host.done
